{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14262","headline":"故秘监丹阳郡公延陵包公挽歌 · 窦牟","name":"故秘监丹阳郡公延陵包公挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台鼎尝虚位，夔龙莫致尧。\n德音冥秘府，风韵散清朝。\n天上文星落，林端玉树凋。\n有吴君子墓，返葬故山遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}